---
import { SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../config';
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---

<Legal
  locale="en"
  path="/support"
  title="Support"
  description="Get help with Riffu: contact us, and answers to common questions."
  dated={false}
>
  <p>
    Write to <a href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}>{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</a>. Tell us your phone model, your
    iOS version and what happened, and we will get back to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Common questions</h2>

  <h3>The sign-in code does not arrive</h3>
  <p>
    Check your spam or promotions folder, and that the email address is spelled right. Then ask the
    app for a new code.
  </p>

  <h3>Riffu does not hear my instrument</h3>
  <p>
    Riffu needs the microphone. Open your iPhone's Settings, find Riffu, and turn the microphone on.
    The sound is only analysed on your phone; it is never recorded or sent anywhere.
  </p>

  <h3>I bought Pro but do not see it</h3>
  <p>
    Pro is linked to your Riffu account. First sign in to the same Riffu account you bought it with.
    Then, on the Pro screen, tap <strong>Restore</strong>, with the App Store signed in to the Apple
    ID you paid with.
  </p>

  <h3>How do I cancel Pro?</h3>
  <p>
    Open your iPhone's Settings, tap your name, then <strong>Subscriptions</strong>. Deleting the
    app or your account does not cancel it. Refunds are handled by Apple.
  </p>

  <h3>How do I delete my account?</h3>
  <p>
    See <a href="/delete-account">Delete your account</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Legal</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
    </li>
  </ul>
</Legal>
